<title>PORTUGAL: Rosy outlook for Portugal wholesale, retail trade.</title>
<headline>Rosy outlook for Portugal wholesale, retail trade.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prospects for wholesale and retail trade in Portugal in the coming months are positive, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>&quot;Expectations for price increases are below those reported in the same period last year,&quot; a monthly report said.</p>
<p>Indicators for activity in both sectors improved in August, INE said.</p>
<p>&quot;These trends were due mainly to the favourable outlook in the retail trade,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
